      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "严格管理保护，虽能确保赛马娘的安全，\n但另一方面却剥夺了成长的可能性。",
      "source_fingerprint": "193180477ce0f7f8bda57ade656d82b157413ca1a79097e76895a948cb1d409c",
