      "uid": "zhcn:34b0d8ec4aeb166f57ab7e9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此选择放手但不移开目光。\n以这种距离感去面对她们，\n若太过火时再好好阻止她们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b948615da544b7b45ef68071012175f29cbcda12ae40e000b00db64a8be4697a",
